## Configuration

### [backend/config.py](file:///C:/Users/Srish/Desktop/ReliefNet/backend/config.py)

All hyperparameters and paths centralized:
- VFA architecture (hidden dims, learning rates)
- Forecasting parameters (ARIMA orders, GARCH p/q)
- ADP settings (discount factor, penalties)
- Optimization constraints (capacities, ranges, speeds)
- SHAP configuration (num samples, max features)

